sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User or trigger
    participant HTTP as Function HTTP API
    participant Entity as Session Entity
    participant DTS as DTS turn orchestrator
    participant Model as MAF model-step activity
    participant APIM as APIM model/control
    participant Foundry as Foundry model
    participant Tool as DTS tool activity
    participant ACA as Customer ACA Sandbox
    participant MCP as APIM remote MCP
    participant Blob as Customer Blob content

    User->>HTTP: Start durable run
    HTTP->>Entity: Admit owner + agent + session + request
    Entity-->>HTTP: Active fence + committed context ref
    HTTP->>Blob: Save prompt and initial run document
    HTTP->>DTS: Start orchestration with refs only

    loop Until the model returns a final answer
        DTS->>Model: Run one model inference
        Model->>Blob: Read verified context refs
        Blob-->>Model: Messages + encrypted reasoning
        Model->>APIM: Responses create / poll
        APIM->>Foundry: Governed model request
        Foundry-->>APIM: Answer or ordered tool calls
        APIM-->>Model: Provider response
        Model->>Blob: Save decision + reasoning
        Model-->>DTS: Decision ref + bounded counters

        alt Local or customer tool
            DTS->>Tool: durable_agent_sandbox_tool_v1
            Tool->>ACA: Create, attach, or resume
            ACA->>ACA: Execute shell, file, or custom tool
            ACA-->>Tool: Tool result + workspace archive
            Tool->>Blob: Save result + workspace checkpoint
            Tool-->>DTS: Result refs
        else Privileged remote MCP
            DTS->>Tool: durable_agent_mcp_tool_v1
            Tool->>MCP: Call governed APIM MCP route
            MCP-->>Tool: MCP result
            Tool->>Blob: Save result
            Tool-->>DTS: Result ref
        else Human input required
            DTS-->>HTTP: Waiting + owner-authorized detail URL
            HTTP-->>User: Question and choices
            User->>HTTP: Submit answer
            HTTP->>DTS: Durable external event
        else Final answer
            DTS->>Blob: Save final response
        end

        Note over DTS,Blob: DTS history carries refs, hashes, counters, and statuses
    end

    DTS->>Entity: Commit context ref + next generation
    Entity-->>DTS: Idempotent commit receipt
    DTS-->>HTTP: Terminal status + response ref
    HTTP->>Blob: Read integrity-checked final response
    Blob-->>HTTP: Final response
    HTTP-->>User: Result

